{"seq":2,"slug":"wal-mode-concurrency","title":"WAL 模式与并发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/sqlite-personal-apps/wal-mode-concurrency","wordCount":1207,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"wal-模式与并发\">WAL 模式与并发</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>SQLite 默认使用 rollback journal 模式——写入时锁定整个数据库，读者必须等待写者完成。对个人应用而言，这在大多数场景下足够，但当你的应用需要同时读写（如后台同步进程写入、前台 UI 读取），或者多个进程共享同一个数据库文件时，WAL（Write-Ahead Logging）模式带来质的飞跃：读者永远不会被写者阻塞，写者也不会被读者阻塞。理解 WAL 的工作原理和调优手段，是将 SQLite 从&quot;够用&quot;提升到&quot;高性能&quot;的关键一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"wal-的工作原理\">WAL 的工作原理</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant W as &quot;写入进程&quot;&#10;    participant WAL as &quot;WAL 文件&quot;&#10;    participant DB as &quot;主数据库&quot;&#10;    participant R as &quot;读取进程&quot;&#10;&#10;    W-&gt;&gt;WAL: 追加新页面&#10;    Note over WAL: 数据先写入 WAL&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;DB: 读取旧页面&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;WAL: 检查 WAL 中是否有更新版本&#10;    Note over R: 读者看到一致快照&#10;    WAL-&gt;&gt;DB: Checkpoint 回写&#10;    Note over DB: 定期将 WAL 合并回主文件\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant W as \"写入进程\"\n    participant WAL as \"WAL 文件\"\n    participant DB as \"主数据库\"\n    participant R as \"读取进程\"\n\n    W-&gt;&gt;WAL: 追加新页面\n    Note over WAL: 数据先写入 WAL\n    R-&gt;&gt;DB: 读取旧页面\n    R-&gt;&gt;WAL: 检查 WAL 中是否有更新版本\n    Note over R: 读者看到一致快照\n    WAL-&gt;&gt;DB: Checkpoint 回写\n    Note over DB: 定期将 WAL 合并回主文件</pre><p>传统 rollback journal：修改前将旧数据复制到 journal 文件，然后直接修改数据库。如果崩溃，用 journal 恢复。</p>\n<p>WAL 模式：新数据追加到 WAL 文件末尾，数据库文件保持不变。读者通过 WAL 索引（wal-index，即 .shm 文件）判断应该读 WAL 中的新版本还是数据库中的旧版本。</p>\n<p>核心优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>读写并发</strong>：写入只追加 WAL，不修改数据库文件，读者不受影响</li>\n<li><strong>更快的写入</strong>：顺序追加比随机写效率更高</li>\n<li><strong>读者不阻塞写者</strong>：多个读者可以同时与一个写者并存</li>\n<li><strong>崩溃安全</strong>：WAL 中的未提交数据在恢复时被忽略</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"并发模型-多读者单写者\">并发模型：多读者单写者</h3><p>WAL 模式下的 SQLite 遵循 MRSW（Multiple Readers, Single Writer）模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>是否阻塞</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读 + 读</td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n<td>任意数量的并发读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读 + 写</td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n<td>读者看到写入前的一致快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写 + 写</td>\n<td>阻塞</td>\n<td>同一时刻只有一个写者（busy_timeout 等待）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Checkpoint + 读</td>\n<td>不阻塞</td>\n<td>Checkpoint 不影响读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Checkpoint + 写</td>\n<td>部分阻塞</td>\n<td>PASSIVE 模式不阻塞，FULL/RESTART 模式可能等待</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"事务隔离级别\">事务隔离级别</h3><p>SQLite WAL 模式提供的是 <strong>快照隔离（Snapshot Isolation）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 事务开始时获取一致性快照&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT * FROM notes;  -- 看到此刻的一致状态&#10;-- 即使其他进程在此期间写入了新数据，本事务看到的仍是开始时的快照&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务开始时获取一致性快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notes;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 看到此刻的一致状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 即使其他进程在此期间写入了新数据，本事务看到的仍是开始时的快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这比&quot;读已提交&quot;更强（避免了不可重复读），但弱于&quot;可串行化&quot;（允许写倾斜异常）。对个人应用场景，快照隔离已经足够。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"启用-wal-模式\">启用 WAL 模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;&#10;const db = new Database(&#39;personal.db&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 启用 WAL（持久设置，关闭重开后仍然生效）&#10;db.pragma(&#39;journal_mode = WAL&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 推荐配合设置&#10;db.pragma(&#39;synchronous = NORMAL&#39;); // WAL 模式下 NORMAL 已足够安全&#10;db.pragma(&#39;busy_timeout = 5000&#39;); // 写锁等待 5 秒&#10;db.pragma(&#39;wal_autocheckpoint = 1000&#39;); // 每 1000 页自动 checkpoint&#10;db.pragma(&#39;cache_size = -64000&#39;); // 64MB 读缓存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal.db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 启用 WAL（持久设置，关闭重开后仍然生效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'journal_mode = WAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推荐配合设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'synchronous = NORMAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// WAL 模式下 NORMAL 已足够安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'busy_timeout = 5000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 写锁等待 5 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wal_autocheckpoint = 1000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每 1000 页自动 checkpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cache_size = -64000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 64MB 读缓存</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"busy_timeout-与写冲突处理\">busy_timeout 与写冲突处理</h3><p>当两个进程同时尝试写入时，后到的写者会收到 SQLITE_BUSY 错误。<code>busy_timeout</code> 设置等待时间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 方案 1：设置 busy_timeout（简单但不够灵活）&#10;db.pragma(&#39;busy_timeout = 5000&#39;); // 等待最多 5 秒&#10;&#10;// 方案 2：自定义 busy handler（更精细的控制）&#10;// better-sqlite3 不支持自定义 handler，但 Python 的 sqlite3 支持&#10;// 在 Node.js 中，配合重试逻辑：&#10;&#10;function writeWithRetry(fn, maxRetries = 3) {&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; maxRetries; i++) {&#10;    try {&#10;      return fn();&#10;    } catch (err) {&#10;      if (err.code === &#39;SQLITE_BUSY&#39; &amp;&amp; i &lt; maxRetries - 1) {&#10;        // 指数退避&#10;        const delay = Math.min(100 * Math.pow(2, i), 2000);&#10;        Atomics.wait(new Int32Array(new SharedArrayBuffer(4)), 0, 0, delay);&#10;        continue;&#10;      }&#10;      throw err;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方案 1：设置 busy_timeout（简单但不够灵活）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'busy_timeout = 5000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等待最多 5 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方案 2：自定义 busy handler（更精细的控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// better-sqlite3 不支持自定义 handler，但 Python 的 sqlite3 支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 Node.js 中，配合重试逻辑：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> writeWithRetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxRetries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxRetries; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err.code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SQLITE_BUSY'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxRetries </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 指数退避</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> delay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, i), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Atomics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Int32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SharedArrayBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, delay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"begin-immediate-避免死锁\">BEGIN IMMEDIATE：避免死锁</h3><p>普通 <code>BEGIN</code> 启动的事务是延迟（DEFERRED）模式——只在第一次写操作时才获取写锁。如果两个事务都先读后写，可能产生死锁：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 进程 A                           -- 进程 B&#10;BEGIN;                              BEGIN;&#10;SELECT * FROM notes;                SELECT * FROM notes;&#10;-- A 尝试升级为写锁                  -- B 也尝试升级为写锁&#10;INSERT INTO notes ...;              INSERT INTO notes ...;&#10;-- 死锁！双方都持有读锁，等待对方释放\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 进程 A                           -- 进程 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notes;                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- A 尝试升级为写锁                  -- B 也尝试升级为写锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notes ...;              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notes ...;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 死锁！双方都持有读锁，等待对方释放</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解决方案：对写事务使用 <code>BEGIN IMMEDIATE</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 写事务始终用 IMMEDIATE&#10;const writeTransaction = db.transaction((data) =&gt; {&#10;  // better-sqlite3 的 transaction() 默认使用 BEGIN IMMEDIATE&#10;  db.prepare(&#39;INSERT INTO notes (id, title) VALUES (?, ?)&#39;).run(data.id, data.title);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 如果用原始 SQL：&#10;db.exec(&#39;BEGIN IMMEDIATE&#39;);&#10;try {&#10;  // ... 写入操作&#10;  db.exec(&#39;COMMIT&#39;);&#10;} catch (e) {&#10;  db.exec(&#39;ROLLBACK&#39;);&#10;  throw e;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 写事务始终用 IMMEDIATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> writeTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // better-sqlite3 的 transaction() 默认使用 BEGIN IMMEDIATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO notes (id, title) VALUES (?, ?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data.id, data.title);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 如果用原始 SQL：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BEGIN IMMEDIATE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // ... 写入操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COMMIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ROLLBACK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"checkpoint-策略\">Checkpoint 策略</h3><p>WAL 文件会持续增长，直到 checkpoint 将其内容回写到主数据库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 检查 WAL 大小&#10;const walInfo = db.pragma(&#39;wal_checkpoint(PASSIVE)&#39;);&#10;// 返回: [{ busy: 0, log: 1500, checkpointed: 1200 }]&#10;// log: WAL 中总页面数, checkpointed: 已回写的页面数&#10;&#10;// 手动触发 checkpoint（不阻塞读写）&#10;db.pragma(&#39;wal_checkpoint(PASSIVE)&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 完整 checkpoint（等待所有读者完成后截断 WAL）&#10;db.pragma(&#39;wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 限制 WAL 大小&#10;db.pragma(&#39;journal_size_limit = 67108864&#39;); // WAL 最大 64MB\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检查 WAL 大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> walInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wal_checkpoint(PASSIVE)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 返回: [{ busy: 0, log: 1500, checkpointed: 1200 }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// log: WAL 中总页面数, checkpointed: 已回写的页面数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 手动触发 checkpoint（不阻塞读写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wal_checkpoint(PASSIVE)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 完整 checkpoint（等待所有读者完成后截断 WAL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 限制 WAL 大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pragma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'journal_size_limit = 67108864'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// WAL 最大 64MB</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Checkpoint 模式对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PASSIVE</td>\n<td>不等待，跳过活跃读者占用的页面</td>\n<td>定时后台执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FULL</td>\n<td>等待所有读者完成，但不截断</td>\n<td>需要完整回写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RESTART</td>\n<td>FULL + 重置 WAL 写入位置</td>\n<td>控制 WAL 大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TRUNCATE</td>\n<td>RESTART + 将 WAL 文件截断为 0</td>\n<td>关闭前清理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"多进程架构推荐\">多进程架构推荐</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;UI 进程&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;只读查询&quot;| DB[&quot;SQLite DB + WAL&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;同步进程&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;写入更新&quot;| DB&#10;    C[&quot;搜索索引进程&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;只读 FTS 查询&quot;| DB&#10;    D[&quot;备份进程&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;PASSIVE checkpoint + 复制&quot;| DB\">graph LR\n    A[\"UI 进程\"] --&gt;|\"只读查询\"| DB[\"SQLite DB + WAL\"]\n    B[\"同步进程\"] --&gt;|\"写入更新\"| DB\n    C[\"搜索索引进程\"] --&gt;|\"只读 FTS 查询\"| DB\n    D[\"备份进程\"] --&gt;|\"PASSIVE checkpoint + 复制\"| DB</pre><ul>\n<li>UI 进程：只做读取，永不被阻塞</li>\n<li>同步进程：用 <code>BEGIN IMMEDIATE</code> 写入远程拉取的数据</li>\n<li>搜索进程：读取 FTS 表，提供搜索建议</li>\n<li>备份进程：定期执行 PASSIVE checkpoint 后复制数据库文件</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"性能调优清单\">性能调优清单</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>journal_mode</td>\n<td>WAL</td>\n<td>并发读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>synchronous</td>\n<td>NORMAL</td>\n<td>WAL 下已足够安全，写入快 2-3x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cache_size</td>\n<td>-64000 (64MB)</td>\n<td>减少磁盘读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mmap_size</td>\n<td>268435456 (256MB)</td>\n<td>内存映射加速大文件读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>temp_store</td>\n<td>MEMORY</td>\n<td>临时表存内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>page_size</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>匹配多数 SSD 扇区大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>busy_timeout</td>\n<td>5000</td>\n<td>避免轻量冲突立即报错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"何时不用-wal\">何时不用 WAL</h3><p>WAL 并非万能——以下场景应保持默认 journal 模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>网络文件系统</strong>：WAL 依赖共享内存（.shm），NFS/SMB 不支持</li>\n<li><strong>只读数据库</strong>：WAL 需要写 .wal 和 .shm 文件</li>\n<li><strong>极端写入密集</strong>：单进程连续写入时，WAL 的额外间接层略慢于 DELETE 模式</li>\n<li><strong>需要原子跨库事务</strong>：ATTACH 的数据库不共享 WAL</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sqlite3 .stats</td>\n<td>查看 WAL 状态</td>\n<td>内置命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PRAGMA wal_checkpoint</td>\n<td>手动 checkpoint</td>\n<td>内置 pragma</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Litestream</td>\n<td>WAL 流式复制</td>\n<td>实时备份到 S3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rqlite</td>\n<td>分布式 SQLite</td>\n<td>基于 Raft + WAL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mvsqlite</td>\n<td>多版本 SQLite</td>\n<td>基于 FoundationDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>litefs</td>\n<td>分布式文件系统</td>\n<td>Fly.io 出品，LTX 格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>WAL 模式是 SQLite 从&quot;单用户嵌入式数据库&quot;进化为&quot;多进程并发数据引擎&quot;的关键特性。对个人数据基础设施，WAL 解决了最常见的架构需求：后台同步进程写入时，前台 UI 依然流畅响应。配置只需三行 pragma（<code>journal_mode=WAL</code>、<code>synchronous=NORMAL</code>、<code>busy_timeout=5000</code>），但理解其背后的原理——快照隔离、MRSW 模型、checkpoint 机制——能帮助你在遇到性能瓶颈或奇怪锁错误时快速定位问题。记住核心规则：读事务用 <code>BEGIN</code>，写事务用 <code>BEGIN IMMEDIATE</code>，定期 checkpoint 控制 WAL 大小。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WAL 模式与并发","id":"wal-模式与并发"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"WAL 的工作原理","id":"wal-的工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"并发模型：多读者单写者","id":"并发模型-多读者单写者"},{"level":3,"text":"事务隔离级别","id":"事务隔离级别"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"启用 WAL 模式","id":"启用-wal-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"busy_timeout 与写冲突处理","id":"busy_timeout-与写冲突处理"},{"level":3,"text":"BEGIN IMMEDIATE：避免死锁","id":"begin-immediate-避免死锁"},{"level":3,"text":"Checkpoint 策略","id":"checkpoint-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"多进程架构推荐","id":"多进程架构推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"性能调优清单","id":"性能调优清单"},{"level":3,"text":"何时不用 WAL","id":"何时不用-wal"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"SQLite 作为应用格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/sqlite-personal-apps/sqlite-as-app-format"},"next":{"title":"个人数据仓库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/sqlite-personal-apps/personal-data-warehouse"}}